 the glory of God. The expanse shows his handiwork.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezekiel 1:22","note":"Over the head of the living creature there was the likeness of an expanse, like an awesome crystal to look at, stretched out over their heads above.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Daniel 12:3","note":"Those who are wise will shine as the brightness of the expanse. Those who turn many to righteousness will shine as the stars forever and ever.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}